<title>BRAZIL: Brazil authorizes Ecuador airlines to operate.</title>
<headline>Brazil authorizes Ecuador airlines to operate.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian President Fernando Henrique Cardoso on Friday signed a decree authorizing Ecuadorean airline Ecuatoriana de Aviacion S.A. to operate in Brazil, officials said.</p>
<p>The decree allowed the airline to operate as a regular air travel company.</p>
<p>The decree will come into effect on the day of publication in the Official Journal, expected to be on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358</p>
</text>
